---
title: Native bridge startup
---
flowchart TD
    ready[Guest ready] --> check[Verify provider]
    check --> inspect[Inspect all sockets]
    check -->|identity changed| fail[Refuse startup]
    inspect -->|unsafe identity| fail
    inspect -->|ready or pending| recheck[Recheck provider]
    recheck -->|identity changed| fail
    recheck --> deadline{Before 10 seconds?}
    deadline -->|no| fail
    deadline -->|yes| complete{All sockets private?}
    complete -->|no| wait[Wait up to 50ms]
    wait --> check
    complete -->|yes| audit[Full audit then adoption]
    fail --> stop[Verified provider stop]
    stop --> retained[Retain failure evidence]
    class ready,check,inspect,recheck live
    class wait wait
    class audit ok
    class fail fail
    class retained idle
